            {
                "entry_id": "1a2bed02-2533-34aa-877d-5035547853c2",
                "word": "MDMA",
                "pos": "abbrev",
                "lang_code": "de",
                "forms": [],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "1abafe4f-3233-3cf2-912a-4d85568f79cc",
                        "entry_id": "1a2bed02-2533-34aa-877d-5035547853c2",
                        "glosses": [
                            "psychoaktives Amphetamin"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "55bfd4d6-a360-438c-8ec8-edf23933eab8",
                                "sense_id": "1abafe4f-3233-3cf2-912a-4d85568f79cc",
                                "text": "MDMA gehört strukturell zur Gruppe der Amphetamine und ist insbesondere als weltweit verbreitete Partydroge bekannt."
                            }
                        ],
                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "c1ddaaec-4c12-4c90-8ae4-1f2112b752a8",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a2bed02-2533-34aa-877d-5035547853c2",
                        "source_sense_id": "1abafe4f-3233-3cf2-912a-4d85568f79cc",
                        "source_sense_description": "psychoaktives Amphetamin",
                        "target_lang_word": "MDMA",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "MDMA",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1d6df2e-286a-3091-92f6-d9e19a53be5e",
                                        "entry_id": "7b807420-ae98-34d9-b665-01f7d74f17e4",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "3,4-methylenedioxymethamphetamine, a synthetic entactogen of the methylenedioxyphenethylamine family."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "738f89bd-5997-41ac-bbc7-d8e46a9bb934",
                                                "sense_id": "c1d6df2e-286a-3091-92f6-d9e19a53be5e",
                                                "text": "Unlike many of its subsequent users, Shulgin did not find his MDMA experience transformative. For him the effect was like a particularly lucid alcohol buzz; he called it his \"low-calorie martini.\""
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "44ec226e-80ba-43db-b355-0a31c4e64f88",
                                                "sense_id": "c1d6df2e-286a-3091-92f6-d9e19a53be5e",
                                                "text": "A bit of folk wisdom from early cohorts of MDMA users advised against getting married within six weeks of one's first MDMA experience."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0d76e2f7-e66f-4bd8-96c0-dbbb3f5c2626",
                                                "sense_id": "c1d6df2e-286a-3091-92f6-d9e19a53be5e",
                                                "text": "When MDMA was placed on Schedule 1, the worst category of illegal drugs, the yuppies stopped partying and the dance scene went underground."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f815bc10-019a-452d-a6e1-6f41987ce40c",
                                                "sense_id": "c1d6df2e-286a-3091-92f6-d9e19a53be5e",
                                                "text": "In an important step toward medical approval, MDMA, the illegal drug popularly known as Ecstasy or Molly, was shown to bring relief to those suffering from severe post-traumatic stress disorder when paired with talk therapy."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ed9ac0e4-fdc6-4658-9d20-f093c75856bb",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a2bed02-2533-34aa-877d-5035547853c2",
                        "source_sense_id": "1abafe4f-3233-3cf2-912a-4d85568f79cc",
                        "source_sense_description": "psychoaktives Amphetamin",
                        "target_lang_word": "MDMA",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "MDMA",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "57ff41b6-bfa6-341e-826a-bd7e09d5a1f3",
                                        "entry_id": "325011a7-a4e2-3444-8668-6659ad1e0b64",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Molécule psychotrope de la famille des amphétamines aux caractéristiques entactogènes."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e34a3e20-9606-41d2-91ed-345abacd2833",
                                                "sense_id": "57ff41b6-bfa6-341e-826a-bd7e09d5a1f3",
                                                "text": "Tu te rappelles la dernière fois, on avait parlé du MDMA, eh ben y a une fille là, une copine de Londres qui en a pris et qui raconte des trucs de ouf sur son twitter... La drogue de l'amour ? Non je savais pas."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3eb6966d-08a8-4d68-bc93-16efeb565bcd",
                                                "sense_id": "57ff41b6-bfa6-341e-826a-bd7e09d5a1f3",
                                                "text": "En janvier dernier, Ayelet Waldman, écrivaine américaine quinquagénaire, racontait dans ses mémoires comment elle avait décidé de prendre de la MDMA avec son mari."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "16dcbddc-2833-4419-a026-adf87edc8fa1",
                                                "sense_id": "57ff41b6-bfa6-341e-826a-bd7e09d5a1f3",
                                                "text": "Après, rien ne t’empêche de repousser cette soirée à plus tard, pour pouvoir profiter pleinement du bonheur et [de] l’empathie commune sous MDMA"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
